  "descriptionHtml": "<p>A structured suede bag always manages to feel luxe. Our Lenox mini crossbody is sized to keep essentials accounted for, with a top zip and interior pocket holding everything in place and a removable strap for the days you'd rather wear it short. We finished it with polished silver hardware, because why not? Your new quiet flex</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Suede</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> 2 way script logo lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustible, removable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.2&quot; (L) x 4.7&quot; (H) x 2.70&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
